    <briefdescription>
<para>XOR Linked <ref refid="struct_list" kindref="compound">List</ref> implementation for memory-efficient bidirectional traversal. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Uses XOR pointer technique to store both next and previous pointers in a single field This reduces memory usage by half compared to a doubly linked list </para>
    </detaileddescription>
